      contexto: 'The Central Railway rebuilds the line between Montevideo and Paso de los Toros and was contracted under the Public-Private Partnership regime between the Ministry of Transport and Public Works and the Grupo Vía Central consortium, using an availability-payment scheme: the state pays for keeping the track usable over the contract term. According to the official project page published by the Ministry of Economy and Finance, the infrastructure\'s service-commencement act was signed on 8 August 2024, and the contract records amendments signed on 26 February 2024 and 17 June 2025, approved by Executive resolutions of 8 May 2024 and 23 July 2025.',
